sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant CS as Content Service
    participant DB as Content DB

    U->>GW: GET /public/content/home
    GW->>CS: Proxy request
    CS->>DB: Query shows + episodes (published)
    DB-->>CS: Show list + Episode list
    CS-->>U: Home feed response

    U->>GW: GET /public/content/shows/{showID}
    GW->>CS: Proxy request
    CS->>DB: Query show + hosts + episodes
    DB-->>CS: Show detail
    CS-->>U: Show detail + episode list

    U->>GW: GET /public/content/episodes/{episodeID}
    GW->>CS: Proxy request
    CS->>DB: Query episode + segments + assets
    DB-->>CS: Episode detail
    CS-->>U: Episode detail (audio_url, segments, assets)

    U->>GW: POST /content/episodes/{id}/bookmark
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT
    GW->>CS: Proxy request
    CS->>DB: INSERT episode_bookmarks
    CS-->>U: 201 Bookmarked
